<title>HONG KONG: HYPO Bank privately places HK$ notes.</title>
<headline>HYPO Bank privately places HK$ notes.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fixed rate medium-term note issue has been privately placed by lead manager Oakreed Financial Services Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER    BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN-UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMOUNT	HK$75 MLN  COUPON    6.85 PCT  MATURITY  24.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	  EUROPEAN MEDIUM-TERM NOTES     ISS PRICE PAR</p>
<p> PUTS	  NONE	 CALLS     NONE	LAUNCHED  09.JAN.97</p>
<p> RATING	AA2	  DENOMS    HK$1 MLN  PAY DATE  23.JAN.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ    QUARTERLY</p>
<p> LEAD	  OAKREED FINANCIAL SERVICES LTD</p>
<p> NOTES	 *TO YIELD 7.03 PCT ANNUALISED.</p>
<p>		 ISSUED OFF US$5 BLN MEDIUM-TERM NOTE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		 DATED MAY 15, 1995.</p>
<p>		 SETTLEMENT THROUGH EUROCLEAR/CEDEL.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
